  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "086DAA5945746551",
      "text": "Do forgive the intrusion.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "086DA75945746038",
      "text": "You are...M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)], yes?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0305"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "086DA859457461EB",
      "text": "On behalf of the academy, I must apologize for\\nthe late arrival of your enrollment documents.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "086DAD5945746A6A",
      "text": "Ah. And also for my delay in introducing myself.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "086DAE5945746C1D",
      "text": "I am the director of Naranja Academy. You may\\ncall me Mr. Clavell.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "08712E5945777B74",
      "text": "I am the director of Uva Academy. You may call\\nme Mr. Clavell.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_01",
      "hash64": "CEBAA8BB4FF1BD84",
      "text": "The director?! And you came in person to help\\nmy [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0803)]sondaughter with h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]iser first day?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0803"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "086DAB5945746704",
      "text": "Well, I am responsible for the entire academy—\\nincluding any failures on its part...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "086DAC59457468B7",
      "text": "So here at last are the enrollment documents\\nthat should have already been delivered to you.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_02",
      "hash64": "CEBAABBB4FF1C29D",
      "text": "Goodness, you really needn’t have...[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_03",
      "hash64": "CEBAAABB4FF1C0EA",
      "text": "Since you’ve come all this way, can I at least\\noffer you a cup of tea?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "086DA15945745606",
      "text": "Ah, no need to trouble yourself...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_04",
      "hash64": "CEBAA5BB4FF1B86B",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], I’ve got a thing or\\ntwo\\r\\nto\\r\\ndiscuss\\r\\nwith\\r\\nthe\\r\\ndirector here.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
