      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_05",
      "hash64": "CEBAA4BB4FF1B6B8",
      "text": "Why don’t you head back up to [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]your room[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] and\\nfinish getting ready for school? You’ll need your\\r\\nbag—and your hat as well![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_06",
      "hash64": "CEBAA7BB4FF1BBD1",
      "text": "Now, Mr. Clavell, you simply must join me for\\na cuppa. This way...[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "086DA259457457B9",
      "text": "Well, how can I refuse such a kind offer?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "08712F5945777D27",
      "text": "Is your room upstairs? No need to concern\\nyourself with me. Go on.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_07",
      "hash64": "CEBAA6BB4FF1BA1E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Off you pop, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Go to\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]your[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]room[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\nand\\r\\nget\\r\\nyourself\\r\\nready for school.\\c\\nYou need your bag—and your hat, too![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
